# left them only on ONE host — a fresh clone/deploy served 50 broken <img> and
# og:image (the final audit found every article image 404 on a fresh host). They
# are small (~5.6MB total) and self-contained, so they live with the code now.
# (Regenerate with scripts/generate_article_images.py if the set changes.)
